# Source book for the drug-interaction-check skill, kept local only.
# "Utilizing Information System to Tackle Drug-Drug Interaction in Clinical
# Setting" (i3L Press, 2021) is a published book, not open-licensed material,
# so it is not redistributed in this public repository. The skill does not
# need it at runtime: the facts it relies on are summarised, with page
# numbers, in references/book-notes.md inside drug-interaction-check.skill.
# Only this file is ignored; other reference PDFs (e.g. siRNA-Skills/references/)
# stay tracked.
DDI-i3L/Drug-Drug-Interaction.pdf
